Not in this repository
----------------------
- The gamecore (a build of the Lekmod fork of the Civilization V CvGameCoreDLL sources) is a separate project
  under its own terms; this program links it only when you build it yourself (see LICENSE-EXCEPTION.md).
- Game data (textures, models, sounds, UI files, the game database, cursors, animation graphs) is produced on
  your machine from your own install by tools/asset-pipeline and is never committed.
- The game's shaders. The WGSL shaders in crates/client/render/src/shaders were written for this project by
  studying the compiled shaders of the game (reverse engineering for interoperability); they contain no
  shader bytecode or source from the game.
